C781 1C781                              1 ;
C781 1C781                              2 ;  Speed-optimized ZX0 decompressor by spke (187 bytes)
C781 1C781                              3 ;
C781 1C781                              4 ;  ver.00 by spke (27/01-23/03/2021, 191 bytes)
C781 1C781                              5 ;  ver.01 by spke (24/03/2021, 193(+2) bytes - fixed a bug in the initialization)
C781 1C781                              6 ;  ver.01patch2 by uniabis (25/03/2021, 191(-2) bytes - fixed a bug with elias over 8bits)
C781 1C781                              7 ;  ver.01patch9 by uniabis (10/09/2021, 187(-4) bytes - support for new v2 format)
C781 1C781                              8 ;
C781 1C781                              9 ;  Original ZX0 decompressors were written by Einar Saukas
C781 1C781                             10 ;
C781 1C781                             11 ;  This decompressor was written on the basis of "Standard" decompressor by
C781 1C781                             12 ;  Einar Saukas and optimized for speed by spke. This decompressor is
C781 1C781                             13 ;  about 5% faster than the "Turbo" decompressor, which is 128 bytes long.
C781 1C781                             14 ;  It has about the same speed as the 412 bytes version of the "Mega" decompressor.
C781 1C781                             15 ;
C781 1C781                             16 ;  The decompressor uses AF, BC, DE, HL and IX and relies upon self-modified code.
C781 1C781                             17 ;
C781 1C781                             18 ;  The decompression is done in the standard way:
C781 1C781                             19 ;
C781 1C781                             20 ;  ld hl,FirstByteOfCompressedData
C781 1C781                             21 ;  ld de,FirstByteOfMemoryForDecompressedData
C781 1C781                             22 ;  call DecompressZX0
C781 1C781                             23 ;
C781 1C781                             24 ;  Of course, ZX0 compression algorithms are (c) 2021 Einar Saukas,
C781 1C781                             25 ;  see https://github.com/einar-saukas/ZX0 for more information
C781 1C781                             26 ;
C781 1C781                             27 ;  Drop me an email if you have any comments/ideas/suggestions: zxintrospec@gmail.com
C781 1C781                             28 ;
C781 1C781                             29 ;  This software is provided 'as-is', without any express or implied
C781 1C781                             30 ;  warranty.  In no event will the authors be held liable for any damages
C781 1C781                             31 ;  arising from the use of this software.
